00:30:42.440 --> 00:30:44.030
SOLEIL KELLEY: The answer is no.

00:30:44.030 --> 00:30:48.840
We don't support
the [? z ?] measure.

00:30:48.840 --> 00:30:51.116
CHAD JENNINGS:
Thanks for that one.

00:30:51.116 --> 00:30:53.240
SOLEIL KELLEY: Hey, these
are questions that people

00:30:53.240 --> 00:30:55.940
