00:30:55.940 --> 00:30:58.940
"Does BigQuery GIS come with
geospatial statistical data,

00:30:58.940 --> 00:31:00.800
for instance, parcel
map data that I can use

00:31:00.800 --> 00:31:02.630
to join with my business data?"

00:31:02.630 --> 00:31:05.040
CHAD JENNINGS: Oh,
that's a great question.

00:31:05.040 --> 00:31:07.250
So not really.

00:31:07.250 --> 00:31:12.350
So BigQuery GIS
comes with BigQuery.

00:31:12.350 --> 00:31:14.630
BigQuery comes with
Google Cloud Platform.

00:31:14.630 --> 00:31:17.840
And inside Google Cloud
Platform are a whole host

00:31:17.840 --> 00:31:18.740
of public datasets.

00:31:18.740 --> 00:31:20.156
And we went through
some of these,

00:31:20.156 --> 00:31:23.570
or I showed you a very
