00:31:23.570 --> 00:31:25.310
If there is some
public datasets that

00:31:25.310 --> 00:31:28.591
have some of that geospatial
statistical data that you want,

00:31:28.591 --> 00:31:29.090
like--

00:31:29.090 --> 00:31:32.930
I do happen to know that zip
code land and water areas are

00:31:32.930 --> 00:31:35.750
there, things like that--

00:31:35.750 --> 00:31:38.000
you might be able to find
them in the public datasets.

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.374
If not, then you're
going to have

00:31:39.374 --> 00:31:42.230
to import them
